    "notes": [
      {
        "moduleIds": [
          2
        ],
        "content": "## Reply to new real estate leads in minutes with Claude, Follow Up Boss and Twilio\n\nReal-estate agents and teams who lose portal leads to whoever answers first.\n\n### How it works\nTrigger: A lead email from Zillow or Realtor.com, a website form submission, or a new person appearing in Follow Up Boss or kvCORE starts the run.\n1. Receive the lead\n2. Look up the lead in the CRM\n3. Qualify\n4. Draft the first reply\n5. Check quiet hours and consent\n6. Send the reply\n7. Log and hand off\n8. Follow up on silence\nEvery AI step is followed by a \"Needs a person?\" gate that parks low-confidence items.\n\n### Setup\n1. Open \"Config (edit me)\" and fill in the fields (names, approver, quiet hours, thresholds).\n2. Add credentials: Anthropic, plus Follow Up Boss / kvCORE / HubSpot, Gmail / Outlook, Twilio.\n3. Run once with test_mode on, read the output, then switch the trigger on.\n\n### Customization tips\nPut your first-reply rules and quiet hours in the Config node; swap Follow Up Boss for kvCORE or HubSpot and Twilio for your SMS provider.\nGuardrail to keep: Quiet hours: nothing sent 9 pm–8 am in the lead's time zone; messages queue until morning.\n\nFull blueprint: https://agentmelt.com/workflows/speed-to-lead-automation/",
        "isFilterNote": false,
        "metadata": {
          "color": "#F5D451"
        }
      }
    ],
